<title>FRANCE: Axa, UAP merge some German units.</title>
<headline>Axa, UAP merge some German units.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Axa and UAP, which merged last November, said they were merging their German unit Axa Direkt Versicherung (ADV) and UAP's Tellit Direct Versicherung into AXA Tellit Versicherung.</p>
<p>The new unit, which plans to become Germany's leading direct insurer in the property-casualty sector, will be 50/50 owned by Axa Direct and UAP's Colonia Konzern.</p>
</text>
